+## The cluster
+
+| Node | Kubernetes | Shape | Capacity |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 10.0.148.221 | v1.35.2 | VM.Standard.A1.Flex | 6 cpu, 24286464Ki |
+| 10.0.159.197 | v1.35.2 | VM.Standard.A1.Flex | 6 cpu, 24286460Ki |
